      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/east_branch_new_york"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The area was part of Lenapehoking, the traditional homeland of the Algonquian‑speaking Lenape people.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
